-- title:
--   Integer Hermite weights and correlation powers at degree 51
-- statement:
--   Two finite interval tables for the cubic–quintic Grothendieck scheme at cutoff 51. The first gives the 1,378 Hermite weight intervals with $a+b\le51$, and the second gives the coefficients through degree 51 of the 52 covariance-polynomial powers. All endpoints are integers in the common units $2^{-144}$. The raw data can be used independently to check the recurrences or evaluate the signed coefficient sums.
-- source:
